    rule2Text: "高温沸腾的乙酸（白醋）会强烈破坏 304 不锈钢表面的三氧化二铬保护膜，造成金属晶界微腐蚀，导致随后 3–5 次烧水时镍析出激增 3 至 6 倍。请使用 2%–5% 食品级柠檬酸水溶液，常温浸泡即可快速溶解水垢且绝不伤金属。",
    rule3Title: "3. 绝对不要使用钢丝球或强力研磨百洁布擦拭底盘",
    rule3Text: "机械钢丝刮擦会破坏不锈钢镜面抛光钝化层，留下微米级划痕毛刺，不仅加速氯离子侵蚀诱发点蚀锈斑，还会使金属离子析出面积扩大数倍。",
    rule4Title: "4. 硬水水质地区每 30 至 60 天定期除垢一次",
    rule4Text: "碳酸钙水垢的导热系数只有不锈钢的 1/13。1 毫米厚的水垢会使底盘工作温度从 110°C 骤升至 180°C 以上，多消耗 10%–15% 的电费，并导致蒸汽开关温控器提前跳闸或发热丝过热烧毁。",
    rule5Title: "5. 镍过敏与湿疹易发人群应首选 316 钢或高硼硅玻璃水壶",
    rule5Text: "患有系统性镍过敏综合征 (SNAS) 或汗疱疹、顽固性湿疹的人群，饮水中的微量镍（>15 µg/L）即可诱发皮疹与肠道不适。建议优先选用含钼的 316 医用级不锈钢壶，或全玻璃壶身配微量金属底盘的电水壶。",
    copyReportBtn: "📋 复制诊断遥测报告",
    reportCopied: "✓ 报告已成功复制到剪贴板！",
    crossLinkTitle: "探索更多水质健康与电热安全工具",
    crossLinkWater: "饮用水含氟量、微塑料与反渗透净水机评估仪",
    crossLinkMigration: "食品接触材料化学迁移扩散预测器",
    crossLinkEnergy: "智能厨房用电与碳足迹计算器"
  },
  ja: {
    badge: "電熱物理学＆飲料水毒性学",
    title: "電気ケトル ニッケル溶出＆水垢熱抵抗シミュレーター",
    subtitle: "電気ケトルのステンレス底面からの重金属（Ni、Cr）溶出（WHO 20 µg/L基準）、炭酸カルシウム水垢による熱伝導阻害、および空焚き過熱リスクを精密算出。",
    controlsTitle: "ケトル金属素材・水質硬度＆使用サイクル設定",
    controlsSub: "ステンレス鋼種、水道水のミネラル硬度、水煮沸後の滞留時間、およびクエン酸／酢による洗浄方法を設定し、重金属溶出量と電力損失を評価します。",
    materialLabel: "ケトルの金属素材＆ヒーター構造",
    materialHelp: "医療用316や食品用304は緻密な酸化クロム不動態被膜を形成しますが、201鋼や昔の露出コイル型は大量のニッケルやマンガンを溶出します。",
    hardnessLabel: "水質ミネラル硬度（CaCO3 炭酸カルシウム量）",
    hardnessHelp: "硬水を加熱すると難溶性の炭酸カルシウム（スケール）がヒーター底面に析出し、断熱層を形成して熱効率を著しく低下させます。",
    dwellLabel: "ケトル内での沸騰後の水滞留・放置時間",
    dwellHelp: "ケトル内に一晩（8〜12時間）または数日間放置された水は、ガルバニック微小腐食により金属イオン濃度が数倍に濃縮されます。",
    cyclesLabel: "洗浄なしでの累積湯沸かし回数",
    cyclesHelp: "水垢を除去せずに何百回も使用すると結晶層が厚くなり、ヒーター内部温度が250℃以上に達して空焚き防止センサーの誤作動を招きます。",
    descalingLabel: "水垢洗浄（スケール除去）方法と薬剤",
    descalingHelp: "食品用クエン酸は金属を傷めずカルシウムをキレート溶解しますが、沸騰した食酢（酢酸）は不動態被膜を溶かし、ニッケル溶出の急増を招きます。",
    presetsTitle: "典型的な使用シナリオのワンクリック設定",
    presetSafe316: "🏆 316 医療用ステンレス＋汲みたて水（安全基準）",
    presetOvernight304: "⚠️ 304 ステンレス＋一晩放置した汲み置き水（ニッケル上昇）",
    presetExposedCoil: "🚨 昔の露出型電熱コイル（重金属ニッケル極めて高リスク）",
    presetVinegarAcidEtch: "🧪 沸騰酢による酸エッチング（不動態破壊による溶出急増）",
    presetHeavyScaleDecouple: "⚡ 高硬度水・厚い水垢熱阻害（ヒーター異常過熱）",
    diagnosticTitle: "毒性学＆熱伝導リアルタイム診断データ",
    diagnosticSub: "WHO（世界保健機関）20 µg/L 飲料水ガイドラインおよびEU飲料水指令 2020/2184に基づき評価。",
    overallScoreLabel: "ケトル純度＆安全性スコア",
    nickelLeachLabel: "推定ニッケル溶出濃度 (µg/L / ppb)",
    snasRiskLabel: "全身性ニッケルアレルギー (SNAS) リスク",
    scaleThicknessLabel: "水垢（カルキ）断熱層の厚さ",
    elementTempLabel: "ヒーター発熱体コア限界温度",
    energyPenaltyLabel: "水垢熱抵抗による電力損失",
    cutoffTripLabel: "サーモスタット誤作動＆素子焼損リスク",
    alertTitle: "毒性学・熱力学エンジニアの診断所見",
    tableTitle: "ケトル金属素材と重金属溶出 比較一覧表",
    tableSub: "ステンレス鋼種、合金組成、耐孔食指数 (PREN)、WHO基準適合状況の比較。",
    colMaterial: "素材＆ヒーター構造",
    colAlloy: "合金組成と特徴",
    colNiRate: "基礎Ni溶出 (ppb)",
    colPren: "耐孔食 PREN",
    colWhoStatus: "WHO 20 µg/L 判定",
    colSnasRisk: "ニッケルアレルギー適合性",
    protocolsTitle: "電気ケトルの安全な使用と金属溶出を防ぐ5つの黄金則",
    protocolsSub: "材料工学者、飲料水毒性学者、および家電安全技術者が推奨する実践策。",
    rule1Title: "1. 一晩放置した水を再沸騰させて飲まない",
    rule1Text: "ケトル内に8〜12時間放置された水は、新鮮な汲みたて水道水に比べて最大5倍のニッケルや重金属を溶出します。残った水は植木に流し、毎朝新鮮な冷たい水道水を注いでください。",
    rule2Title: "2. 水垢除去には必ずクエン酸を使い、酢の煮沸は避ける",
    rule2Text: "沸騰した酢酸（食酢）は304ステンレスの不動態クロム皮膜を化学的に浸食し、その後の数回の湯沸かしでニッケル溶出量を3〜6倍に跳ね上げます。2〜5%の食品用クエン酸水溶液をご使用ください。",
    rule3Title: "3. 底面プレートをスチールたわしで絶対に擦らない",
    rule3Text: "金属たわしによる物理的な摩擦傷は、鏡面仕上げの不動態層を破壊し、微小な隙間に塩素が蓄積して孔食（サビ・穴あき）を急激に進行させます。",
    rule4Title: "4. 硬水地域では30〜60日ごとに定期的なカルキ抜きを行う",
    rule4Text: "炭酸カルシウム水垢の熱伝導率はステンレスの1/13以下です。1 mmの水垢がつくとヒーター温度は180℃以上に跳ね上がり、電気代が10〜15%余計にかかります。",
    rule5Title: "5. 金属アレルギー体質の方は316鋼またはガラス製を選択する",
    rule5Text: "全身性ニッケルアレルギー症候群（SNAS）や掌蹠膿疱症、アトピー性皮膚炎をお持ちの方は、モリブデンを含む316医療用ステンレス製または耐熱ガラス製ケトルが最も安全です。",
    copyReportBtn: "📋 診断レポートをコピー",
    reportCopied: "✓ レポートをクリップボードにコピーしました！",
    crossLinkTitle: "関連する水質およびエネルギー診断ツール",
    crossLinkWater: "水道水フッ素・マイクロプラスチック＆RO浄水器アナライザー",
    crossLinkMigration: "食品接触材料化学移行・拡散予測シミュレーター",
    crossLinkEnergy: "スマートキッチン消費電力＆CO2計算機"
  }
};

const d = dict[lang] || dict.en;
---

<div class="kettle-modeler-wrapper my-8 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-surface border border-hairline shadow-sm space-y-8">
  <!-- Header Badge -->
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-hairline pb-6">
    <div class="space-y-1">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-blue-100 text-blue-900">
        <span>⚡</span>
        {d.badge}
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink tracking-tight">
        {d.title}
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-body max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        {d.subtitle}
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <button 
        id="btn-copy-kettle-report"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-ink text-canvas hover:bg-ink/90 text-xs font-semibold transition-all shadow-xs active:scale-95 cursor-pointer"
      >
        <span id="copy-kettle-btn-text">{d.copyReportBtn}</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Presets Panel -->
  <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline space-y-3">
    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider block">{d.presetsTitle}</span>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <button type="button" class="preset-kettle-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-canvas hover:bg-surface border border-hairline text-ink transition-colors cursor-pointer" data-material="316-surgical-steel" data-hardness="soft" data-dwell="fresh-pour" data-cycles="25" data-descaling="citric-acid">
        {d.presetSafe316}
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="preset-kettle-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-canvas hover:bg-surface border border-hairline text-ink transition-colors cursor-pointer" data-material="304-food-grade" data-hardness="moderate" data-dwell="overnight-10h" data-cycles="80" data-descaling="citric-acid">
        {d.presetOvernight304}
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="preset-kettle-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-canvas hover:bg-surface border border-hairline text-red-900 bg-red-50 hover:bg-red-100 border-red-200 transition-colors cursor-pointer" data-material="exposed-immersion-coil" data-hardness="hard" data-dwell="fresh-pour" data-cycles="150" data-descaling="abrasive-scouring">
        {d.presetExposedCoil}
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="preset-kettle-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-canvas hover:bg-surface border border-hairline text-orange-900 bg-orange-50 hover:bg-orange-100 border-orange-200 transition-colors cursor-pointer" data-material="304-food-grade" data-hardness="moderate" data-dwell="fresh-pour" data-cycles="40" data-descaling="white-vinegar">
        {d.presetVinegarAcidEtch}
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="preset-kettle-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-canvas hover:bg-surface border border-hairline text-purple-900 bg-purple-50 hover:bg-purple-100 border-purple-200 transition-colors cursor-pointer" data-material="201-low-nickel-steel" data-hardness="very-hard" data-dwell="fresh-pour" data-cycles="350" data-descaling="neglected-scale">
        {d.presetHeavyScaleDecouple}
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Grid: Controls vs Real-Time Telemetry -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
    <!-- Left Column: Controls (7 cols) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
      <div class="border-b border-hairline pb-2">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-ink">{d.controlsTitle}</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed mt-0.5">{d.controlsSub}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Control 1: Metallurgy & Construction -->
      <div class="space-y-1.5">
        <label for="select-kettle-material" class="block text-xs font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider">
          {d.materialLabel}
        </label>
        <select 
          id="select-kettle-material"
          class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-hairline text-ink text-xs font-medium focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 transition-shadow cursor-pointer"
        >
          {kettleData.kettleMaterials.map((m) => (
            <option value={m.id} selected={m.id === '304-food-grade'}>
              {m.name}
            </option>
          ))}
        </select>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted leading-relaxed">{d.materialHelp}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Control 2: Water Hardness Tier -->
      <div class="space-y-1.5">
        <label for="select-water-hardness" class="block text-xs font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider">
          {d.hardnessLabel}
        </label>
        <select 
          id="select-water-hardness"
          class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-hairline text-ink text-xs font-medium focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 transition-shadow cursor-pointer"
        >
          {kettleData.waterHardnessTiers.map((h) => (
            <option value={h.id} selected={h.id === 'moderate'}>
              {h.name}
            </option>
          ))}
        </select>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted leading-relaxed">{d.hardnessHelp}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Control 3: Water Dwell / Standing Time -->
      <div class="space-y-1.5">
        <label for="select-water-dwell" class="block text-xs font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider">
          {d.dwellLabel}
        </label>
        <select 
          id="select-water-dwell"
          class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-hairline text-ink text-xs font-medium focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 transition-shadow cursor-pointer"
        >
          {kettleData.waterDwellTimes.map((dw) => (
            <option value={dw.id} selected={dw.id === 'fresh-pour'}>
              {dw.name}
            </option>
          ))}
        </select>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted leading-relaxed">{d.dwellHelp}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Control 4: Boil Cycles Slider -->
      <div class="space-y-2 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <label for="slider-boil-cycles" class="text-xs font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider">
            {d.cyclesLabel}
          </label>
          <span id="display-boil-cycles" class="text-sm font-extrabold text-blue-900 font-mono">
            40 boils
          </span>
        </div>
        <input 
          type="range" 
          id="slider-boil-cycles"
          min="1" 
          max="500" 
          step="5" 
          value="40"
          class="w-full accent-blue-600 cursor-pointer"
        />
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted leading-relaxed">{d.cyclesHelp}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Control 5: Descaling Method -->
      <div class="space-y-1.5">
        <label for="select-descaling-protocol" class="block text-xs font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider">
          {d.descalingLabel}
        </label>
        <select 
          id="select-descaling-protocol"
          class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-hairline text-ink text-xs font-medium focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 transition-shadow cursor-pointer"
        >
          {kettleData.descalingProtocols.map((dp) => (
            <option value={dp.id} selected={dp.id === 'citric-acid'}>
              {dp.name}
            </option>
          ))}
        </select>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted leading-relaxed">{d.descalingHelp}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Real-Time Diagnostic Telemetry (5 cols) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4">
      <div class="border-b border-hairline pb-2">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-ink">{d.diagnosticTitle}</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed mt-0.5">{d.diagnosticSub}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Overall Index Score Card -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-canvas border border-hairline text-center space-y-2 shadow-xs">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider block">
          {d.overallScoreLabel}
        </span>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-center gap-1">
          <span id="val-kettle-score" class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-ink font-mono tracking-tight">
            92
          </span>
          <span class="text-lg font-bold text-muted font-mono">/ 100</span>
        </div>
        <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider" id="badge-kettle-status">
          Optimal Food Contact
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Key Diagnostic Metrics Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <!-- Metric 1: Nickel Leaching Concentration -->
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline space-y-1">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider block">
            {d.nickelLeachLabel}
          </span>
          <span id="val-nickel-leach" class="text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold text-ink font-mono block">
            4.8 µg/L
          </span>
          <span id="sub-nickel-who" class="text-[10px] text-emerald-800 font-semibold block">
            ✓ Compliant (&lt;20 µg/L WHO)
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Metric 2: SNAS Allergy Risk -->
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline space-y-1">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider block">
            {d.snasRiskLabel}
          </span>
          <span id="val-snas-risk" class="text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold text-emerald-800 font-mono block">
            Safe
          </span>
          <span id="sub-snas-risk" class="text-[10px] text-muted block">
            Below 15 ppb trigger
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Metric 3: Limescale Thickness -->
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline space-y-1">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider block">
            {d.scaleThicknessLabel}
          </span>
          <span id="val-scale-thickness" class="text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold text-ink font-mono block">
            0.04 mm
          </span>
          <span id="sub-scale-thickness" class="text-[10px] text-muted block">
            Negligible thermal barrier
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Metric 4: Element Core Temp -->
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline space-y-1">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider block">
            {d.elementTempLabel}
          </span>
          <span id="val-element-temp" class="text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold text-ink font-mono block">
            113°C / 235°F
          </span>
          <span id="sub-element-temp" class="text-[10px] text-emerald-800 font-semibold block">
            Normal water coupling
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Metric 5: Energy Efficiency Penalty -->
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline space-y-1">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider block">
            {d.energyPenaltyLabel}
          </span>
          <span id="val-energy-loss" class="text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold text-ink font-mono block">
            +0.4%
          </span>
          <span id="sub-energy-loss" class="text-[10px] text-muted block">
            Minimal electricity waste
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Metric 6: Cutoff False-Trip Risk -->
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline space-y-1">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider block">
            {d.cutoffTripLabel}
          </span>
          <span id="val-cutoff-risk" class="text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold text-ink font-mono block">
            2% Risk
          </span>
          <span id="sub-cutoff-risk" class="text-[10px] text-emerald-800 font-semibold block">
            Strix switch stable
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Actionable Advisory Alert Banner -->
      <div id="banner-kettle-alert" class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-blue-950 space-y-1.5 transition-all">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span id="kettle-alert-icon" class="text-lg">💧</span>
          <h4 id="kettle-alert-heading" class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-950">
            {d.alertTitle}
          </h4>
        </div>
        <p id="kettle-alert-body" class="text-xs text-blue-950 leading-relaxed">
          Evaluating electric kettle metallurgy and chemical migration parameters...
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Reference Comparison Table: Stainless Steel Metallurgy & Limits -->
  <div class="border-t border-hairline pt-8 space-y-4">
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">{d.tableTitle}</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed mt-0.5">{d.tableSub}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-hairline">
      <table class="w-full text-left text-xs border-collapse">
        <thead class="bg-surface-soft border-b border-hairline text-ink font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
          <tr>
            <th class="p-3.5">{d.colMaterial}</th>
            <th class="p-3.5">{d.colAlloy}</th>
            <th class="p-3.5 text-center">{d.colNiRate}</th>
            <th class="p-3.5 text-center">{d.colPren}</th>
            <th class="p-3.5">{d.colWhoStatus}</th>
            <th class="p-3.5">{d.colSnasRisk}</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-hairline bg-canvas">
          {kettleData.kettleMaterials.map((mat) => (
            <tr class="hover:bg-surface-soft/60 transition-colors">
              <td class="p-3.5 font-bold text-ink whitespace-nowrap">
                {mat.name.split('–')[0].trim()}
              </td>
              <td class="p-3.5 text-body max-w-xs leading-relaxed">
                {mat.alloyDesignation}
              </td>
              <td class="p-3.5 text-center font-mono font-bold text-ink">
                {mat.baseNiLeachRatePpb}
              </td>
              <td class="p-3.5 text-center font-mono text-muted">
                {mat.pittingResistanceEquivalent}
              </td>
              <td class="p-3.5">
                <span class={`inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold ${
                  mat.baseNiLeachRatePpb <= 5 ? 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-900' :
                  mat.baseNiLeachRatePpb <= 20 ? 'bg-amber-100 text-amber-900' : 'bg-red-100 text-red-900'
                }`}>
                  {mat.whoCompliance.split('(')[0].trim()}
                </span>
              </td>
              <td class="p-3.5 text-body max-w-xs leading-relaxed">
                {mat.snasAllergyRisk.split('(')[0].trim()}
              </td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 5 Golden Safety Rules -->
  <div class="border-t border-hairline pt-8 space-y-4">
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">{d.protocolsTitle}</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed mt-0.5">{d.protocolsSub}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline space-y-1.5">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-ink">{d.rule1Title}</h4>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">{d.rule1Text}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline space-y-1.5">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-ink">{d.rule2Title}</h4>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">{d.rule2Text}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline space-y-1.5">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-ink">{d.rule3Title}</h4>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">{d.rule3Text}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline space-y-1.5">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-ink">{d.rule4Title}</h4>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">{d.rule4Text}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline space-y-1.5">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-ink">{d.rule5Title}</h4>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">{d.rule5Text}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-blue-950 space-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-center">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-blue-950">💧 WHO 20 µg/L Directive Guideline</h4>
        <p class="text-blue-950 leading-relaxed">
          The World Health Organization (WHO) and European Union (EU 2020/2184) drinking water standard mandates that ingested nickel must not exceed 20 µg/L (20 ppb) to protect against systemic allergic dermatitis.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Related Tools Cross-Links -->
  <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-hairline flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs">
    <span class="font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider">{d.crossLinkTitle}:</span>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <a href="/tools/water-filter-efficiency-analyzer/" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-soft hover:bg-surface-strong border border-hairline text-ink font-medium transition-colors">
        &rarr; {d.crossLinkWater}
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/food-contact-migration-predictor/" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-soft hover:bg-surface-strong border border-hairline text-ink font-medium transition-colors">
        &rarr; {d.crossLinkMigration}
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/kitchen-energy-carbon-calculator/" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-soft hover:bg-surface-strong border border-hairline text-ink font-medium transition-colors">
        &rarr; {d.crossLinkEnergy}
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Client-Side Real-Time Diagnostic Engine -->
<script define:vars={{ kettleData, reportCopiedText: d.reportCopied, copyBtnOriginalText: d.copyReportBtn }}>
  (function initKettleEngine() {
    const materialSelect = document.getElementById('select-kettle-material');
    const hardnessSelect = document.getElementById('select-water-hardness');
    const dwellSelect = document.getElementById('select-water-dwell');
    const cyclesSlider = document.getElementById('slider-boil-cycles');
    const cyclesDisplay = document.getElementById('display-boil-cycles');
    const descalingSelect = document.getElementById('select-descaling-protocol');
    const copyBtn = document.getElementById('btn-copy-kettle-report');
    const copyBtnText = document.getElementById('copy-kettle-btn-text');
    const presetButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.preset-kettle-btn');

    // Telemetry Outputs
    const valKettleScore = document.getElementById('val-kettle-score');
    const badgeKettleStatus = document.getElementById('badge-kettle-status');
    const valNickelLeach = document.getElementById('val-nickel-leach');
    const subNickelWho = document.getElementById('sub-nickel-who');
    const valSnasRisk = document.getElementById('val-snas-risk');
    const subSnasRisk = document.getElementById('sub-snas-risk');
    const valScaleThickness = document.getElementById('val-scale-thickness');
    const subScaleThickness = document.getElementById('sub-scale-thickness');
    const valElementTemp = document.getElementById('val-element-temp');
    const subElementTemp = document.getElementById('sub-element-temp');
    const valEnergyLoss = document.getElementById('val-energy-loss');
    const subEnergyLoss = document.getElementById('sub-energy-loss');
    const valCutoffRisk = document.getElementById('val-cutoff-risk');
    const subCutoffRisk = document.getElementById('sub-cutoff-risk');
    const bannerAlert = document.getElementById('banner-kettle-alert');
    const alertIcon = document.getElementById('kettle-alert-icon');
    const alertHeading = document.getElementById('kettle-alert-heading');
    const alertBody = document.getElementById('kettle-alert-body');

    function updateCalculations() {
      if (!materialSelect || !hardnessSelect || !dwellSelect || !cyclesSlider || !descalingSelect) return;

      const matId = materialSelect.value;
      const hardId = hardnessSelect.value;
      const dwellId = dwellSelect.value;
      const cycles = parseInt(cyclesSlider.value, 10);
      const descId = descalingSelect.value;

      if (cyclesDisplay) {
        cyclesDisplay.textContent = `${cycles} boils`;
      }

      const matObj = kettleData.kettleMaterials.find(m => m.id === matId) || kettleData.kettleMaterials[1];
      const hardObj = kettleData.waterHardnessTiers.find(h => h.id === hardId) || kettleData.waterHardnessTiers[1];
      const dwellObj = kettleData.waterDwellTimes.find(dw => dw.id === dwellId) || kettleData.waterDwellTimes[0];
      const descObj = kettleData.descalingProtocols.find(dp => dp.id === descId) || kettleData.descalingProtocols[0];

      // 1. Calculate Limescale Thickness (mm)
      // Accumulation rate based on water hardness and boil cycles
      let scaleMm = (cycles / 100) * hardObj.scaleDepositionRateMmPer100Boils;
      if (descObj.id === 'citric-acid') {
        scaleMm = Math.max(0.01, scaleMm * 0.15); // Well maintained with citric acid
      } else if (descObj.id === 'white-vinegar') {
        scaleMm = Math.max(0.02, scaleMm * 0.35); // Partial scale clearing
      } else if (descObj.id === 'abrasive-scouring') {
        scaleMm = Math.max(0.03, scaleMm * 0.40);
      } // neglected-scale leaves full scaleMm

      // Cap realistic scale thickness to 4.5 mm
      scaleMm = Math.min(4.5, Math.max(0.01, scaleMm));

      // 2. Thermodynamic Calculations: Element Core Temp & Thermal Decoupling
      // Delta T = q'' * (scaleMm / 1000) / kLimescale
      const qFlux = kettleData.thermodynamicConstants.nominalHeatFluxWPerM2; // ~85,714 W/m2
      const kScale = kettleData.thermodynamicConstants.kLimescaleWmK; // 1.2 W/(m*K)
      const deltaTempC = (qFlux * (scaleMm / 1000)) / kScale;
      const baseWaterBoilInterfaceTempC = 108; // Normal interface temp under active boil
      const elementCoreTempC = Math.round(baseWaterBoilInterfaceTempC + deltaTempC);
      const elementCoreTempF = Math.round(elementCoreTempC * 1.8 + 32);

      // Energy Loss Percentage (due to thermal lag, element heat capacity & radiant loss)
      const energyPenaltyPct = Math.min(28.0, Number((scaleMm * 5.8).toFixed(1)));

      // Thermostat Switch Cutoff False-Trip Risk (%)
      // Standard Strix bimetal control trips around 135°C on dry-boil
      let cutoffTripRisk = 0;
      if (elementCoreTempC < 130) {
        cutoffTripRisk = 2;
      } else if (elementCoreTempC < 160) {
        cutoffTripRisk = Math.round(((elementCoreTempC - 130) / 30) * 35 + 5);
      } else if (elementCoreTempC < 220) {
        cutoffTripRisk = Math.round(((elementCoreTempC - 160) / 60) * 45 + 40);
      } else {
        cutoffTripRisk = Math.min(99, Math.round(((elementCoreTempC - 220) / 50) * 15 + 85));
      }

      // 3. Heavy Metal (Nickel) Leaching Calculations (µg/L or ppb)
      // Base rate * Dwell Multiplier * Descaling Post-Treatment Factor * Water Corrosion Factor
      let calculatedNiPpb = matObj.baseNiLeachRatePpb * dwellObj.leachMultiplier * descObj.postDescalingLeachFactor * hardObj.corrosionFactor;

      // Incomplete passivation penalty on brand-new kettle (<10 boils)
      if (cycles <= 5 && matId !== '316-surgical-steel') {
        calculatedNiPpb *= 1.85; // Initial unpassivated surface spike
      }

      // High scale slightly buffers metal surface if undisturbed, but under-deposit crevice corrosion spikes it
      if (descObj.id === 'neglected-scale' && scaleMm > 1.0) {
        calculatedNiPpb *= 1.4; // Crevice pitting under scale
      }

      calculatedNiPpb = Number(calculatedNiPpb.toFixed(1));

      // 4. Clinical SNAS Risk Classification
      let snasCategory = 'Safe';
      let snasColorClass = 'text-emerald-800';
      if (calculatedNiPpb < 8.0) {
        snasCategory = 'Safe (<8 ppb)';
        snasColorClass = 'text-emerald-800';
      } else if (calculatedNiPpb <= 15.0) {
        snasCategory = 'Low Risk (8–15 ppb)';
        snasColorClass = 'text-blue-800';
      } else if (calculatedNiPpb <= 20.0) {
        snasCategory = 'Moderate / WHO Ceiling';
        snasColorClass = 'text-amber-800';
      } else if (calculatedNiPpb <= 45.0) {
        snasCategory = 'Elevated SNAS Trigger';
        snasColorClass = 'text-orange-800';
      } else {
        snasCategory = 'Severe Toxic Risk (>45 ppb)';
        snasColorClass = 'text-rose-800';
      }

      // 5. Overall Kettle Purity & Safety Health Index (0 to 100)
      let overallScore = 100;
      // Deduct for Ni concentration (>20 ppb drops heavily)
      if (calculatedNiPpb > 20) {
        overallScore -= Math.min(50, (calculatedNiPpb - 20) * 1.5 + 20);
      } else {
        overallScore -= (calculatedNiPpb / 20) * 15;
      }

      // Deduct for scale & thermal decoupling
      overallScore -= Math.min(25, scaleMm * 12);

      // Deduct for dangerous descaling or materials
      if (descObj.id === 'white-vinegar') overallScore -= 12;
      if (descObj.id === 'abrasive-scouring') overallScore -= 22;
      if (matId === 'exposed-immersion-coil') overallScore -= 30;
      if (matId === '201-low-nickel-steel') overallScore -= 18;

      overallScore = Math.max(12, Math.min(99, Math.round(overallScore)));

      // Update DOM
      if (valKettleScore) valKettleScore.textContent = overallScore;

      if (badgeKettleStatus) {
        if (overallScore >= 85) {
          badgeKettleStatus.className = 'inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-900';
          badgeKettleStatus.textContent = 'Gold Standard / Ultra Pure';
        } else if (overallScore >= 68) {
          badgeKettleStatus.className = 'inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-blue-100 text-blue-900';
          badgeKettleStatus.textContent = 'Acceptable Household Quality';
        } else if (overallScore >= 45) {
          badgeKettleStatus.className = 'inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-amber-100 text-amber-900';
          badgeKettleStatus.textContent = 'Elevated Risk / Maintenance Due';
        } else {
          badgeKettleStatus.className = 'inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-red-100 text-red-900';
          badgeKettleStatus.textContent = 'Critical Hazard / Non-Compliant';
        }
      }

      if (valNickelLeach) valNickelLeach.textContent = `${calculatedNiPpb} µg/L`;
      if (subNickelWho) {
        if (calculatedNiPpb <= 20.0) {
          subNickelWho.className = 'text-[10px] text-emerald-800 font-semibold block';
          subNickelWho.textContent = `✓ WHO Compliant (${Math.round((calculatedNiPpb / 20) * 100)}% of limit)`;
        } else {
          subNickelWho.className = 'text-[10px] text-red-800 font-bold block';
          subNickelWho.textContent = `🚨 Breaches WHO 20 µg/L (${(calculatedNiPpb / 20).toFixed(1)}x over)`;
        }
      }

      if (valSnasRisk) {
        valSnasRisk.textContent = snasCategory.split('(')[0].trim();
        valSnasRisk.className = `text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold font-mono block ${snasColorClass}`;
      }
      if (subSnasRisk) {
        subSnasRisk.textContent = calculatedNiPpb <= 15 ? 'Safe for nickel allergy sufferers' : 'Triggers eczema & allergic flare-ups';
      }

      if (valScaleThickness) valScaleThickness.textContent = `${scaleMm.toFixed(2)} mm`;
      if (subScaleThickness) {
        subScaleThickness.textContent = scaleMm < 0.2 ? 'Clean element coupling' : scaleMm < 0.8 ? 'Moderate calcite crust' : 'Heavy insulating thermal blanket';
      }

      if (valElementTemp) valElementTemp.textContent = `${elementCoreTempC}°C / ${elementCoreTempF}°F`;
      if (subElementTemp) {
        if (elementCoreTempC < 140) {
          subElementTemp.className = 'text-[10px] text-emerald-800 font-semibold block';
          subElementTemp.textContent = 'Normal water-cooled range';
        } else if (elementCoreTempC < 200) {
          subElementTemp.className = 'text-[10px] text-amber-800 font-bold block';
          subElementTemp.textContent = 'Thermal stress accumulation';
        } else {
          subElementTemp.className = 'text-[10px] text-red-800 font-bold block';
          subElementTemp.textContent = 'Severe overheating (>200°C)';
        }
      }

      if (valEnergyLoss) valEnergyLoss.textContent = `+${energyPenaltyPct}%`;
      if (subEnergyLoss) {
        subEnergyLoss.textContent = energyPenaltyPct < 2.0 ? 'Optimal electric efficiency' : `Wastes ~${Math.round(energyPenaltyPct * 1.8)} kWh/yr in heat lag`;
      }

      if (valCutoffRisk) valCutoffRisk.textContent = `${cutoffTripRisk}% Risk`;
      if (subCutoffRisk) {
        subCutoffRisk.textContent = cutoffTripRisk < 15 ? 'Bimetal Strix switch reliable' : cutoffTripRisk < 50 ? 'Occasional premature shutoff' : 'High risk of dry-boil trip & burnout';
        subCutoffRisk.className = cutoffTripRisk < 25 ? 'text-[10px] text-emerald-800 font-semibold block' : 'text-[10px] text-red-800 font-bold block';
      }

      // Update Actionable Alert Banner
      if (bannerAlert && alertIcon && alertHeading && alertBody) {
        if (matId === 'exposed-immersion-coil') {
          bannerAlert.className = 'p-4 rounded-2xl bg-red-50 border border-red-300 text-red-950 space-y-1.5 transition-all';
          alertIcon.textContent = '🚨';
          alertHeading.textContent = 'Critical Health Alert: Exposed Immersion Element';
          alertHeading.className = 'text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-red-950';
          alertBody.textContent = `Raw coiled heating elements submerged in water reach extreme local temperatures, fracturing nickel plating and leaching ${calculatedNiPpb} µg/L of toxic nickel into tea and coffee. Replace immediately with a concealed flat-base kettle.`;
        } else if (descId === 'white-vinegar') {
          bannerAlert.className = 'p-4 rounded-2xl bg-orange-50 border border-orange-300 text-orange-950 space-y-1.5 transition-all';
          alertIcon.textContent = '⚠️';
          alertHeading.textContent = 'Passivation Etch Warning: Hot Vinegar Used';
          alertHeading.className = 'text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-orange-950';
          alertBody.textContent = `Boiling 5% white vinegar (acetic acid) dissolves the chromium oxide passivation layer of stainless steel, causing a 3x–6x spike in nickel leaching (${calculatedNiPpb} µg/L) across subsequent boils. Switch to food-grade citric acid.`;
        } else if (dwellId === 'overnight-10h' || dwellId === 'multi-day-48h') {
          bannerAlert.className = 'p-4 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-300 text-amber-950 space-y-1.5 transition-all';
          alertIcon.textContent = '⚠️';
          alertHeading.textContent = 'Water Stagnation Warning: Overnight Water Reheated';
          alertHeading.className = 'text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-950';
          alertBody.textContent = `Allowing boiled water to stand in the kettle overnight allows passive galvanic dissolution to elevate nickel concentration to ${calculatedNiPpb} µg/L. Always discard standing water and fill with fresh cold tap water.`;
        } else if (scaleMm >= 1.2) {
          bannerAlert.className = 'p-4 rounded-2xl bg-purple-50 border border-purple-300 text-purple-950 space-y-1.5 transition-all';
          alertIcon.textContent = '⚡';
          alertHeading.textContent = 'Thermodynamic Warning: Severe Limescale Decoupling';
          alertHeading.className = 'text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-950';
          alertBody.textContent = `Thick ${scaleMm.toFixed(2)} mm limescale crust has decoupled the heating plate, forcing the core to ${elementCoreTempC}°C. This wastes +${energyPenaltyPct}% electricity and creates loud kettle rumble. Descale with 2% citric acid now.`;
        } else {
          bannerAlert.className = 'p-4 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-300 text-emerald-950 space-y-1.5 transition-all';
          alertIcon.textContent = '✓';
          alertHeading.textContent = 'Optimal Purity & Thermal Performance';
          alertHeading.className = 'text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-950';
          alertBody.textContent = `Estimated nickel release is exceptionally low (${calculatedNiPpb} µg/L), well below the WHO 20 µg/L guideline. Heating element is properly water-cooled at ${elementCoreTempC}°C with minimal thermal resistance.`;
        }
      }
    }

    // Event Listeners
    materialSelect?.addEventListener('change', updateCalculations);
    hardnessSelect?.addEventListener('change', updateCalculations);
    dwellSelect?.addEventListener('change', updateCalculations);
    cyclesSlider?.addEventListener('input', updateCalculations);
    descalingSelect?.addEventListener('change', updateCalculations);

    // Preset Buttons
    presetButtons.forEach(btn => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const mat = btn.getAttribute('data-material');
        const hard = btn.getAttribute('data-hardness');
        const dwell = btn.getAttribute('data-dwell');
        const cycles = btn.getAttribute('data-cycles');
        const desc = btn.getAttribute('data-descaling');

        if (mat && materialSelect) materialSelect.value = mat;
        if (hard && hardnessSelect) hardnessSelect.value = hard;
        if (dwell && dwellSelect) dwellSelect.value = dwell;
        if (cycles && cyclesSlider) cyclesSlider.value = cycles;
        if (desc && descalingSelect) descalingSelect.value = desc;

        updateCalculations();
      });
    });

    // Copy Telemetry Report to Clipboard
    copyBtn?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const mat = (materialSelect && materialSelect.options[materialSelect.selectedIndex]) ? materialSelect.options[materialSelect.selectedIndex].text : '';
      const hard = (hardnessSelect && hardnessSelect.options[hardnessSelect.selectedIndex]) ? hardnessSelect.options[hardnessSelect.selectedIndex].text : '';
      const dwell = (dwellSelect && dwellSelect.options[dwellSelect.selectedIndex]) ? dwellSelect.options[dwellSelect.selectedIndex].text : '';
      const desc = (descalingSelect && descalingSelect.options[descalingSelect.selectedIndex]) ? descalingSelect.options[descalingSelect.selectedIndex].text : '';
      const score = valKettleScore ? valKettleScore.textContent : '0';
      const ni = valNickelLeach ? valNickelLeach.textContent : '0';
      const snas = valSnasRisk ? valSnasRisk.textContent : '';
      const scaleVal = valScaleThickness ? valScaleThickness.textContent : '0';
      const temp = valElementTemp ? valElementTemp.textContent : '0';
      const energy = valEnergyLoss ? valEnergyLoss.textContent : '0';
      const cyclesVal = cyclesSlider ? cyclesSlider.value : '0';

      const reportText = 'IsItKitchenSafe - Electric Kettle Nickel Leaching & Scale Modeler Report\n' +
        '======================================================================\n' +
        'Kettle Metallurgy: ' + mat + '\n' +
        'Water Hardness: ' + hard + '\n' +
        'Dwell / Standing Time: ' + dwell + '\n' +
        'Boil Cycles: ' + cyclesVal + '\n' +
        'Descaling Method: ' + desc + '\n' +
        '----------------------------------------------------------------------\n' +
        'Purity & Safety Index: ' + score + ' / 100\n' +
        'Nickel Concentration: ' + ni + ' (WHO Limit: 20 µg/L)\n' +
        'SNAS Allergy Profile: ' + snas + '\n' +
        'Limescale Thickness: ' + scaleVal + '\n' +
        'Element Core Temperature: ' + temp + '\n' +
        'Thermal Efficiency Penalty: ' + energy + '\n' +
        '======================================================================\n' +
        'Generated via IsItKitchenSafe: https://isitkitchensafe.com/tools/electric-kettle-nickel-modeler/';

      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(reportText);
        if (copyBtnText) copyBtnText.textContent = reportCopiedText;
        setTimeout(() => {
          if (copyBtnText) copyBtnText.textContent = copyBtnOriginalText;
        }, 2500);
      } catch (err) {
        console.error('Failed to copy kettle telemetry report:', err);
      }
    });

    // Initial Trigger
    updateCalculations();
  })();
</script>
